        (15, "Assess whether prohibition alone can end child marriage in India.", "Prohibition changes visibility more reliably than it changes the household calculation, so the assessment must state the voidable and void distinction precisely, name the recorded causes of persistence and attach an instrument to each cause before concluding.", [10, 11, 18, 12]),
