        (20, "Evaluate the proposition that statutory oversight is the weakest link in India's child-protection system.", "Oversight is recommendatory by design rather than weak by accident, so the evaluation must state the commission's composition and actual powers, show what it can initiate, locate the enforcement lever elsewhere and test the claim against the delivery and data limbs.", [13, 17, 12, 19]),
